4-S005","kind":"main","cn":"手机显示“无服务”。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းမှာ \"လိုင်းမရှိ\" လို့ ပြနေတယ်။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"把SIM卡重新插一下试试。","meaning_my":"ဆင်းမ်ကတ်ကို ထုတ်ပြီး ပြန်ထည့်ကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S006","kind":"main","cn":"只能打紧急电话。","meaning_my":"အရေးပေါ်ဖုန်းပဲ ခေါ်လို့ရတယ်။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S007","kind":"main","cn":"手机有信号吗？","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းလိုင်း မိလား။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"只有一格。","meaning_my":"လိုင်းအား တစ်တန်းပဲ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S008","kind":"main","cn":"电话打不出去。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းခေါ်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S008_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"打不了电话。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းခေါ်မရဘူး။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S008_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S009","kind":"main","cn":"开了流量还是上不了网。","meaning_my":"မိုဘိုင်းဒေတာ ဖွင့်ထားပေမယ့် အင်တာနက် သုံးလို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S010","kind":"main","cn":"移动数据开了吗？","meaning_my":"မိုဘိုင်းဒေတာ ဖွင့်ထားလား။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S011","kind":"main","cn":"数据漫游开了吗？","meaning_my":"ဒေတာရိုမင်း ဖွင့်ထားလား။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S012","kind":"main","cn":"你那边能上网吗？","meaning_my":"မင်းဘက်မှာ အင်တာနက် သုံးလို့ရလား။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S012_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"能，我这边正常。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ဒီဘက်မှာ ပုံမှန်ပါပဲ။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S012_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S013","kind":"main","cn":"网络时好时坏。","meaning_my":"အင်တာနက်လိုင်းက တစ်ခါကောင်း တစ်ခါဆိုး ဖြစ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S013_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"网一会儿好，一会儿坏。","meaning_my":"အင်တာနက်က တစ်ခါကောင်း တစ်ခါဆိုး ဖြစ်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S013_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S014","kind":"main","cn":"网页一直打不开。","meaning_my":"ဝက်ဘ်စာမျက်နှာ ဖွင့်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S015","kind":"main","cn":"视频通话老是卡。","meaning_my":"ဗီဒီယိုကောလ် ခဏခဏ ထစ်တယ်။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S016","kind":"main","cn":"路由器重启过了吗？","meaning_my":"Wi-Fi ရောက်တာကို ပိတ်ပြီး ပြန်ဖွင့်ကြည့်ပြီးပြီလား။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"重启过了，还是没网。","meaning_my":"ပိတ်ဖွင့်ပြီးပြီ၊ အင်တာနက် မရသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S017","kind":"main","cn":"可以帮我检查一下网络吗？","meaning_my":"အင်တာနက်လိုင်း စစ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S018","kind":"main","cn":"能帮我报修网络吗？","meaning_my":"အင်တာနက်ပျက်တာကို ပြင်ဖို့ တိုင်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S018_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，我帮你联系维修人员。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ပြင်ပေးမယ့်သူကို ဆက်သွယ်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S018_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S019","kind":"main","cn":"宽带断了。","meaning_my":"အိမ်သုံးအင်တာနက်လိုင်း ပြတ်သွားပြီ။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S020","kind":"main","cn":"网络什么时候恢复？","meaning_my":"အင်တာနက် ဘယ်တော့ ပြန်ကောင်းမလဲ။","audio_file":"07.01.04-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"07.01.04-S020_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"还不确定，等通知吧。","meaning_my":"မသေချာ